  "result": "Subcommands now get their own slice of the parent's `default_map`. Before, they were handed the parent's entire map, so a nested `{\"runserver\": {\"port\": 5000}}` was looked up under the wrong level and ignored.\n\nThe fix is one line in `Context.__init__` in `src/click/core.py`. It now reads `default_map = parent.default_map.get(info_name)` instead of `default_map = parent.default_map`.\n\nThe existing test suite passes (1906 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed). I didn't add a regression test for the nested `default_map` case.",
